<title>USA: Amphenol sets 3 mln share repurchase.</title>
<headline>Amphenol sets 3 mln share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>WALLINGFORD, Conn. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amphenol Corp said Wednesday it board of directors approved the repurchase of up to three million shares of the company's common stock on the open market until March 31, 1998.</p>
<p>Amphenol said it currently has about 45 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
